1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 4=

10
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:02,460
Surely you don't still believe

11
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:05,020
that Grand Secretary Cui Hong

12
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:07,310
would keep a discarded pawn
like you alive?

13
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:12,100
Gu Hanyi.

14
00:01:12,990 --> 00:01:14,750
If someone put you up to this,

15
00:01:15,630 --> 00:01:17,220
it's not too late to turn back.

16
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:20,750
Just tell me who's behind this
and clear my name.

17
00:01:21,270 --> 00:01:22,470
Money, power,

18
00:01:23,270 --> 00:01:24,340
I can give you anything.

19
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:25,340
Lord Zhao.

20
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,790
You're going to be executed tomorrow.

21
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:31,260
The families
of the pregnant women you poisoned

22
00:01:32,390 --> 00:01:34,900
and the women you drove to their deaths

23
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:36,260
will all be there

24
00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:38,600
to watch you meet your end

25
00:01:39,470 --> 00:01:40,860
and see you off on your final journey.

26
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:43,830
I've been framed!

27
00:01:45,390 --> 00:01:46,180
Gu Hanyi.

28
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:48,790
I've never wronged you.

29
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:51,430
Why are you so determined
to see me dead?

30
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:52,470
Framed?

31
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:58,300
The 37 members of my Shen family
were far more innocent than you.

32
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:01,950
The Shen... The Shen family?

33
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:05,260
Who are you?

34
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:11,340
Shen Ji's daughter, Shen Li.

35
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:12,900
Shen Li?

36
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:19,540
You will all pay for what you've done!

37
00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:28,540
So that's it.

38
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:33,780
Then that means

39
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:37,030
you have the epidemic volume
of The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas.

40
00:02:41,750 --> 00:02:42,900
I knew it.

41
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:46,140
No wonder we
couldn't find it even after burning

42
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:46,980
the Shen residence to the ground.

43
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:49,950
That old fox Shen Ji

44
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:52,180
had planned ahead.

45
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:53,420
Zhao Wujiu.

46
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:56,980
When you and Cui Hong
slaughtered my entire family

47
00:02:57,030 --> 00:02:58,230
for a medical text,

48
00:02:58,900 --> 00:03:00,620
you should have known
this day would come.

49
00:03:01,670 --> 00:03:02,900
This is the price you pay.

50
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:07,070
However,

51
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:10,630
if you're willing to reveal

52
00:03:11,390 --> 00:03:14,580
the accomplice with the man-eating flower
tattoo on the back of his hand,

53
00:03:17,790 --> 00:03:20,300
I might find a way to keep
you alive for two more days.

54
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:25,580
So you don't know who he is.

55
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:26,910
Fine.

56
00:03:27,790 --> 00:03:28,510
Get me out of here.

57
00:03:29,070 --> 00:03:30,140
If you can get me out,

58
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:31,510
I'll tell you who he is.

59
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:36,790
But if you let me die here,

60
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,020
you'll never find out.

61
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:41,070
Then

62
00:03:42,790 --> 00:03:44,830
I wish you well on your
final journey tomorrow, Lord Zhao.

63
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:47,580
Gu Hanyi, come back!

64
00:03:48,420 --> 00:03:50,830
Shen Li! Don't go!

65
00:03:51,350 --> 00:03:51,980
I want to see Cui Hong!

66
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:53,830
I want to see the Grand Secretary!

67
00:03:54,670 --> 00:03:55,630
Mei Jiu sent word

68
00:03:56,070 --> 00:03:57,950
that Cui Hong has already sent men
to investigate your background.

69
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:03,740
It seems the Grand Secretary
is getting anxious.

70
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,730
The higher you rise,
the bigger the target.

71
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:08,070
You're in the spotlight now.

72
00:04:09,110 --> 00:04:10,070
Of course he'd be wary of you.

73
00:04:11,670 --> 00:04:12,790
Then let him investigate.

74
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:14,540
The more thoroughly, the better.

75
00:04:15,110 --> 00:04:16,020
For this blood debt,

76
00:04:16,540 --> 00:04:18,670
I'll make them pay
for every life they took.

77
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:40,830
Zhao Wujiu!

78
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:41,910
So this day has finally come for you!

79
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:43,140
Heaven has finally served justice!

80
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:44,230
You deserve to die!

81
00:04:44,390 --> 00:04:45,670
Give me back my good name!

82
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:47,260
Give me back my parents!

83
00:04:53,780 --> 00:04:56,060
(Cang Ying, Cui Hong's subordinate)

84
00:04:57,420 --> 00:04:59,110
Zhao Wujiu, you fool.

85
00:04:59,390 --> 00:05:01,390
I helped you become Deputy Director
of the Imperial Medical Service,

86
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:03,420
yet you couldn't even handle
a mere medical attendant.

87
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,230
Then consider this
silencing drug my parting gift.

88
00:05:05,390 --> 00:05:07,260
We can't have you saying anything
you shouldn't at the execution ground.

89
00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:09,190
You have no one to blame but yourself,

90
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,300
certainly not me.

91
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:11,020
Kill him!

92
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:13,870
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

93
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:16,630
The appointed hour has come.

94
00:05:17,190 --> 00:05:17,950
Proceed with the execution.

95
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:25,260
(Hongyun Gate)

96
00:05:26,660 --> 00:05:28,020
(Father, Mother.)

97
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:29,700
(Zhao Wujiu has been executed.)

98
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:31,100
(Did you see?)

99
00:05:31,870 --> 00:05:33,900
(Cui Hong is the one
truly responsible for your deaths.)

100
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:36,550
(This game has only just begun.)

101
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:39,550
(He's next.)

102
00:05:42,770 --> 00:05:43,950
(Cui Residence Birthday Banquet)
In three days,

103
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:45,190
Cui Hong will celebrate
his sixtieth birthday.

104
00:05:46,140 --> 00:05:47,510
He has invited many prominent figures
from the Capital.

105
00:05:48,830 --> 00:05:49,950
I may not be a powerful official,

106
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:52,430
but I am renowned
for once saving His Majesty.

107
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:54,260
I am also among the invited guests.

108
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:58,100
Are you willing
to face your second enemy?

109
00:05:58,900 --> 00:05:59,580
Back then,

110
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:03,750
my elder brother
was killed by Cui Hong's henchmen.

111
00:06:05,780 --> 00:06:08,020
The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas
that my brother died protecting

112
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,310
were also taken by him.

113
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:12,780
What belongs to the Shen family,

114
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:15,660
I will reclaim with my own hands.

115
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:22,860
(Cui Residence)

116
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:27,070
Young Master.

117
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:29,750
I'm feeling a little short of breath.

118
00:06:29,950 --> 00:06:31,310
I'd like to step out
into the corridor for some air.

119
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:37,070
All right. Go ahead.

120
00:06:37,990 --> 00:06:39,900
The paths in this residence
can be confusing.

121
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:41,750
Watch your step.

122
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:28,180
(The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas)

123
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:29,220
Li.

124
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:31,780
Stay alive.

125
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:34,750
Go, quickly!

126
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:37,310
The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas.

127
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:48,310
Back then, the Shen daughter's
body disappeared without a trace.

128
00:07:48,660 --> 00:07:50,220
I suspect she wasn't
truly dead at the time.

129
00:07:51,010 --> 00:07:52,310
She may have regained
consciousness and escaped,

130
00:07:52,310 --> 00:07:53,450
or someone may have rescued her.

131
00:07:55,580 --> 00:07:57,580
Her survival may not be a bad thing.

132
00:07:58,460 --> 00:07:59,700
She must know

133
00:07:59,700 --> 00:08:00,900
where the epidemic volume is.

134
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:03,340
Search every inch of the land.

135
00:08:03,990 --> 00:08:06,070
Find her and the epidemic volume

136
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:07,430
of The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas.

137
00:08:07,660 --> 00:08:08,100
Yes.

138
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:10,780
Watch where you're going.

139
00:08:11,390 --> 00:08:11,900
Who's there?

140
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:15,700
Mr. Xie.

141
00:08:16,780 --> 00:08:18,460
Grand Secretary.

142
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:20,580
My apologies.

143
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:23,550
I had a little too much to drink today.

144
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:25,630
No harm done.

145
00:08:25,950 --> 00:08:26,830
I may have

146
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:28,070
had a little too much.

147
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:31,260
All right.

148
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:33,780
Next time, I'll have
a few more drinks with you.

149
00:08:34,750 --> 00:08:35,460
A few more drinks.

150
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:37,310
No need to see me out.

151
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:41,550
Then I won't keep you
gentlemen any longer.

152
00:08:41,780 --> 00:08:44,140
I'll be heading back now.

153
00:08:45,310 --> 00:08:46,550
Take care, Mr. Xie.

154
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,850
No need to see me out.

155
00:08:49,310 --> 00:08:50,610
We'll talk again another day.

156
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:52,430
Another day.

157
00:09:06,870 --> 00:09:09,020
Have you thoroughly investigated
Gu Hanyi's background?

158
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:09,990
Sir.

159
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:11,780
Every detail
of her background checks out.

160
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:14,460
She is the daughter of Gu Mingyuan,
a medicine merchant from Jiangnan.

161
00:09:15,220 --> 00:09:16,880
After her parents died,
her family fell on hard times.

162
00:09:17,230 --> 00:09:18,620
She came to the Capital
to stay with a distant uncle

163
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:19,880
who runs an apothecary
in the western district.

164
00:09:20,550 --> 00:09:21,220
So it makes perfect sense

165
00:09:21,950 --> 00:09:22,780
that she has medical knowledge.

166
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:29,580
A flawless story

167
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:31,980
is a flaw in itself.

168
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:33,830
You mean...

169
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:45,460
Zhao Wujiu may be dead,

170
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:47,310
but we still need
to eliminate his accomplices.

171
00:09:47,830 --> 00:09:50,220
The real threat
is still in the imperial court.

172
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:53,270
I learned from my inquiries
at the Imperial Medical Service

173
00:09:53,830 --> 00:09:56,310
that Consort Cui has long suffered
from severe headaches.

174
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:57,860
None of the physicians
at the Imperial Medical Service

175
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:58,580
have been able to help.

176
00:09:58,950 --> 00:09:59,790
Perhaps this

177
00:10:00,340 --> 00:10:03,030
is my only chance
to get close to Cui Hong.

178
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:04,070
Master.

179
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:06,190
I have a plan.

180
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:26,880
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

181
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:30,580
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

182
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:34,060
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

183
00:10:34,910 --> 00:10:37,900
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

184
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:42,070
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

185
00:10:42,410 --> 00:10:45,700
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

186
00:10:46,050 --> 00:10:52,530
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

187
00:10:53,320 --> 00:11:00,410
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

188
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:10,760
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

189
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:12,870
♪I stand here today♪

190
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:17,520
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

191
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:25,010
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

192
00:11:25,650 --> 00:11:26,940
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

193
00:11:26,940 --> 00:11:29,340
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

194
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:36,630
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
